      "writtenOn": "2026-07-27T16:54:58Z",
      "side": 0,
      "message": "\u003e I think removing this and calling cache_tag_assign_domain() down will cause assigning DEVTLB tags to be missed.\n\nIndeed...\n\nHow about simply calling cache_tag_assign_domain() _after_ intel_pasid_setup_first_level()? It seems the order makes no difference otherwise (and for example the host\u0027s `dmar_domain_attach_device()` also calls it after, not before)?\n\n(...And this looks like yet another proof that, as I already noted for example in aosp/4172647, we\u0027d better properly track \"devices\"/contexts in a special data structure on pKVM side, to remember parameters like ats_supported in it, instead of deriving them from tables every time and hacking upstream code for that.)",
